  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"351\"></span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></span></p><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組改變了遊戲中特定方塊的視覺呈現，將原本軸向綁定的選取框改為傾斜選取框，使其更符合模型外觀，並提升方塊的整體視覺效果。</span></h4><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34ZhTuy.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"827\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourceful-bees.gitbook.io%252fresourceful-lib%252fhighlights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Wiki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhighlight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V0Za7Hm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_BisectPromo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"419\"></a></p>",
